      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“B计划”……或许离走进死胡同\n也相差不远了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21a385100dd2a57d45efd29a7f18baff8735742fa36e8d78abe70bd37a659b4d",
