    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b377646aeb2b56b0a2cd7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我实在说不出口。\n毕竟这是我和曼城茶座缔结契约时，\n与她最初立下的约定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55633b86211fc368ef184a81e6ee5a95572b9b78a6add9c06d334d88eb06105c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
